@baseUrl = http://localhost:8182/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_RECEBIDO_NO_LOGIN

### Saúde
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login — use o e-mail e a senha definidos no arquivo .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin@contabil.local","password":"SUA_SENHA_DEFINIDA_NO_ENV"}

### Listar notas
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar nota
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"issue_date":"2026-11-12","supplier":"Fornecedor Exemplo","number":"123","city":"Guarapuava","state":"PR","icms_base":"30.00","icms_total":"3.60","ipi_total":"1.50","gross_total":"30.00","net_total":"31.50","items":[{"sku":"SKU-1","description":"Produto de teste","cfop":"1102","quantity":"3","unit_price":"10.00","icms_base":"30.00","icms_rate":"12.0000","ipi_rate":"5.0000"}]}

### Notas pendentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?pending_only=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Apurar notas (substitua pelo ID efetivo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tax-assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"name":"Apuração de teste","invoice_ids":[1]}

### Histórico de apurações
GET {{baseUrl}}/tax-assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Fornecedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Catálogo de produtos
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog-products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
